msgid "M02_AUDIT"
msgstr "[M02 evidence]\nLink the sender and new destination through R204.\nEvidence for the current case. Read source to identify its acquisition route; verify record ID, payload and provenance rather than its filename.\n\nNIGHT HANDOFF\njob N47 changed destination under request R204\nRetention: original retained; necessary copy only.\n"

