msgid "M02_BRIEF"
msgstr "Seoyun passed me your copy. I am Doyun, formerly on the night network. N47 is not marked failed, so why is a transmission missing? Reading files alphabetically can hide the important line.\n\nCompare the current log, rotated log and deployment note by job ID. This is not a repair job. First find who sent what, and where.\n\nThese are in-scope read and inspection accounts. Authority to read does not establish the conclusion.\n\n[Case access]\nlogreader@relay02.packet.test / patrol-ember\nregistrar@custodym02.packet.test / paper-thrush\n\nIndependent exhibits required: The Missing Transmission Number\n[Field ledger access]\nlogreader@relay-desk.packet.test / patrol-ember-desk\n[Independent ledger access]\nregistrar@registry-desk.packet.test / paper-thrush-desk\nRead the ledger filenames for the business references named in the job.\n"

msgid "M02_CONTEXT"
msgstr "[Link the sender and new destination through R204.]\n\nLocate the relevant entries in the work ledger. Do not conflate another event with a similar name or time. Identifiers, requests and paths below are retained as observed.\n\njob | request | destination\nN47 | R204 | transit04\nN46 | R203 | archive"

msgid "M02_E1_FIELD"
msgstr "[The Missing Transmission Number · Field Ledger]\nFind the observations for the handed-over business reference and compare the two entries. Mixing a similar unrelated row would conflate different incidents.\n\nREFERENCE R204\n\nFIELD DESK\nrotated:N47:R204\n\nHANDOFF TRANSCRIPT\ncurrent:N47:R204\n\nOTHER ENTRY\nreference: OTHER-R204\nobservation: unrelated service job\n"

msgid "M02_E1_FINDING"
msgstr "[The Missing Transmission Number]\nThe rows before and after rotation share job N47 and request R204.\n\nBusiness reference: R204\nRetain the acquisition source and the next related ledger together."

msgid "M02_E1_RETAINED"
msgstr "[The Missing Transmission Number · Independent Ledger]\nThese observations were retained by a separate desk rather than copied from the live response. Match reference to the earlier business identifier and select the relevant row only.\n\nREFERENCE | DESK | OBSERVATION\nR204 | retained-witness | rotated:N47:R204 / current:N47:R204\nOTHER-R204 | other-job | unrelated\n"

